  abilityId: 2850808
  abilityName: Endless Miracle
  abilityDesc: 33 combo massive Light attack on all foes (uses all allies' BB gauge),
    fills all allies' BB gauge to max, damage taken hugely boosts BB gauge and enormously
    restores HP for 4 turns, 100% damage reduction for 3 turns & considerably boosts
    OD gauge
